title:
Create a stem plot.

# Example: Simple Stem Chart
```JavaScript
PlotAxes.make()
        .stem({
          y: C3.Array.patternOfDbl(10, n => 10 + Math.random() * 40),
          lineFmt: ':',
          markerFmt: 'C0D',
          bottom: 25
        }).show();
```

@see PlotAxes
